   * - The invitation record is permanently removed from the database
   * - No email notification is sent to the invited person
   * - No employee record is created from the deleted invitation
   * - Any pending signup attempts using the invitation token will fail
   *
   * @param connection
   * @param invitationId Target invitation's unique identifier
   * @x-autobe-authorization-type null
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor member
   * @x-autobe-specification Delete pending invitation by ID. Verify user belongs to the organization that sent the invitation. Check that the invitation exists and has status 'pending'. Permanently remove the invitation record from the database. Do NOT soft-delete — use hard delete with CASCADE delete to related records.
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
   */
  @TypedRoute.Delete(":invitationId")
  public async erase(
    @MemberAuth()
    member: MemberPayload,
    @TypedParam("invitationId")
