   * - Filter by hrm_tracker_organization_id for members with time:manage permission
   * - Apply project_id filter if provided in request body
   * - Apply date range filter using date >= start_date AND date <= end_date
   * - Apply billable filter if provided
   * - Join with hrm_tracker_projects for project summary information
   * - Calculate total hours from timelog duration_in_minutes
