    } catch (error) {
      console.log(error);
      throw error;
    }
  }

  /**
   * Retrieve a specific timelog entry by its ID.
   *
   * This operation fetches detailed information about a single timelog, including the employee who recorded the time, the project and optional task worked on, the date and duration of work, and whether the time is billable. Timelogs represent time entries recorded by employees for work performed on projects or tasks within an organization.
   *
   * **Security and Authorization**
   *
   * Employees can only retrieve their own timelogs. Users with the time:view_all permission can retrieve any timelog within their organization. The system enforces ownership verification or permission checks before returning the timelog data.
   *
   * **Data Context**
   *
   * Timelogs belong to an organization for multi-tenancy isolation and are linked to employees, projects, and optionally tasks. This operation returns all relevant context including the employee details, project name, and task information if applicable.
